  "data": {
    "document": "Event Companion",
    "section": "Teams Event Companion",
    "summary": "After [determining the victor](vsdata:core-rule/event-companion.determine-victor.teams), each player earns **Battle Points** (BP) for their team from their VP margin (own VP minus the opponent's). The 2 players' BP always total 20:\n\n- Margin 0–5: 10 BP each.\n- Each further 5 VP of margin (6–10, 11–15 and so on) moves 1 more BP from the lower scorer to the higher.\n- Margin 51 or more: 20 BP to 0.\n\nWhen the round ends, add up each team's BP. A team wins the match if it leads by at least the margin for its size; any smaller lead is a draw:\n\n- 3 players: 4 BP.\n- 4 or 5 players: 6 BP.\n- 6 players: 8 BP.\n- 7 players: 10 BP.\n- 8 players: 12 BP.\n\nThe match winner gets 3 **Team Points** (TP) and the loser 1 TP; a draw gives each team 2 TP.",
